OL,3,GNEWSAScot carves out a place at world
OL,4,Awood-chopping championships
OL,5,
OL,6,F"To try and recompense them for the
OL,7,Fnoise and racket that I make they get
OL,8,Fall the logs and chips and firewood
OL,9,Fthat I have got," he told BBC Radio
OL,10,FScotland Breakfast.
